# Text set

Membership in a list of texts, asked by the atlas tree on the server and in the browser.

## Note
Whether a list of ids holds this one, compared as text. The browser build cannot test list
containment over text, so the tree and its page both ask this instead.

## To holdsText (xs: Seq of Text) and (t: Text) -> Bool:
    Repeat for x in xs:
        If x is equal to t:
            Return true.
    Return false.
